# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 1. Start: i_clear.sav (Ephraim's REAL clear save, game slot 1 'Epilogue'; first 32 KiB FNV-1a 5e8e92c8). The title menu (Restart Chapter): Extras, Map, slot 1: the post-game world map (Ephraim at the Black Temple); the cursor nudged off the node, A: the world map menu, Save, slot 2 (a game save: 'Creature Campaign'); L 14 times: the cursor to the Tower of Valni, A: Ephraim walks there; its preparations, Start: floor 1 (index 36), the first player phase; A on an empty square: the map menu, Suspend, Yes (a suspend save).
# 7000 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
